<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
                 <div class="content-bt">2023博士生国际招生面试交流会参会通知</div>
                <div class="content-bt-xia">
                    <span>发布时间：2023年11月07日 14:17</span><span>来源：</span><span>点击：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1281831001, 13160)</script></span>
                </div> 
        <div id="vsb_content" class="content-content">
                    <p><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:Calibri; panose-1:2 15 5 2 2 2 4 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:等线;} @font-face {font-family:楷体_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@等线";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:blue; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#954F72; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;} p.1, li.1, div.1 {mso-style-name:列出段落1; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; text-indent:21.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.msolistparagraph0, li.msolistparagraph0, div.msolistparagraph0 {mso-style-name:msolistparagraph; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; text-indent:21.0pt; font-size:16.0pt; font-family:"Calibri","sans-serif";} span.15 {mso-style-name:15; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif"; font-weight:bold;}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><a name="_GoBack"></a><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">各教学单位、各位同学：</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">由中国教育国际交流协会主办的“<span lang="EN-US">2023</span>博士生国际招生面试线上交流会<span lang="EN-US">/PhD Workshop China 2023</span>”将于<strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋;">2023</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;">年<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">18-19</span>日</span></strong>在北京、<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">21</span>日在上海举办。</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">该交流会的宗旨是为有志出国攻读博士的中国学生和国外招收博士生的学校和导师搭建一个交流、沟通与面试的平台，让双方利用这个面对面交流的机会，使海外院校代表能够向中国学生介绍博士生学科项目、专业申请知识、奖学金项目，并现场指导申请程序、进行面试等；同时，国内学生也能获得权威、全面、丰富、专业、准确的博士留学信息。</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">截至目前，来自澳大利亚、加拿大、德国、马来西亚、新加坡、西班牙、荷兰、英国、美国等<span lang="EN-US">10</span>多个国家<span lang="EN-US">30</span>多所大学及研究机构的研究生院报名参会。届时将有逾百位院校的博士生教授、导师和招生主管参加北京和上海两场活动，详解各自学校和院系的博士研究生招生政策、资助、奖学金申请、学科专业申请等，并面试会谈提前预约的学生。</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">欢迎参加院校讲座，并与海外院校教授、老师一对一面试和交流，获得更多权威、真实的读博信息。</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">现将参加交流会的有关事宜通知如下：</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">一、对该交流会感兴趣的同学，请登陆网站：</span><a href="http://www.phdworkshop.cn/"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">www.phdworkshop.cn</span></a><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">点击“参会观众”分别提前在线注册，或关注微信公众号：博士生交流会、进行注册。</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">二、提前与参会院校教授老师线上预约并确认面试会谈，凭打印或手机截屏的参会确认函邮件现场参会。</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">三、网站注册截止日期：<strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋;">2023</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;">年<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">15</span>日</span></strong>；</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 21pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">四、为提高咨询效率，请有意申请<span lang="EN-US">2024</span>年国家公派研究生项目的同学事先认真了解国外院校情况，提前做好准备并<strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;">携带个人简历、成绩单、有关外语考试成绩证明和留学计划，学术及科研背景介绍等材料</span></strong>参加交流会；</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 27.75pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">请浏览该交流会网站获得更加详细的内容，欢迎大家参加！</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 27.75pt;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">附件<span lang="EN-US">1</span>：</span><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">2023</span><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">博士生国际招生面试交流会日程安排</span></p>
 <div align="center">
