     <td width="621" valign="top" colspan="4" style="padding: 0cm 5.4pt; border: 1pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 466.1pt; height: 15.4pt; border-image: none;"><p class="1" style="text-indent: 0cm;"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋;">1.</span></strong><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋;">北京日程：</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">日期：<span lang="EN-US">2023</span>年<span lang="EN-US">11</span>月<span lang="EN-US">18</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-19</span>日（周六<span lang="EN-US">-</span>周日）</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 18pt;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">地点：北京市海淀区紫竹院路<span lang="EN-US">29</span>号，北京香格里拉饭店新阁二层大宴会厅</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-indent: 48.2pt;"><strong><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">（地铁<span lang="EN-US">16</span>号线<span lang="EN-US">“</span>万寿寺<span lang="EN-US">”</span>站<span lang="EN-US">D</span>出口，站外步行约<span lang="EN-US"> 400 </span>米）</span></strong></p></td>
    </tr>
