 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 27.75pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 27.75pt; text-justify: inter-ideograph;"><span style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;">附件<span lang="EN-US">2</span>：参会院校名单二维码</span></p>
 <p style="background: white; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; text-indent: 27.75pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="color: black; font-family: 仿宋; font-size: 16pt;"><img width="183" height="183" id="图片 1" src="/__local/F/3F/B6/8203B26D6927D6D16E18FABCBAB_5AF5C0A0_8BEB.jpg" border="0" vwidth="183" vheight="183" vurl="/_vsl/F3FB68203B26D6927D6D16E18FABCBAB/5AF5C0A0/8BEB" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/F/3F/B6/8203B26D6927D6D16E18FABCBAB_5AF5C0A0_8BEB.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
